2025-05-26 11:17:56,602 - agentpress - DEBUG - api.py:666 - [DEBUG] Received response from agent_gen: {'message_id': '324709d0-8c1a-4ac4-b07b-f17447fdfd50', 'thread_id': 'bba32dcb-93dc-4404-95d4-7b06a48f90fb', 'type': 'tool', 'is_llm_message': True, 'content': '{"role": "user", "content": "<tool_result> <scrape-webpage> ToolResult(success=True, output=\'[\\\\n  {\\\\n    \\"Title\\": \\"ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus Compared: Best AI Assistant for 2025 \\\\\\\\u00bb 365i\\",\\\\n    \\"URL\\": \\"https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/2025/05/24/chatgpt-vs-claude-vs-manus-compared-best-ai-assistant-for-2025/\\",\\\\n    \\"Text\\": \\"# ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus Compared: Best AI Assistant for 2025\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCategories[AI](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/category/ai/)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nViewRecentPostsLatestAnnouncementsOurNewsTips&TricksShortVideosFunnyPosts\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n![ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus](https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ChatGPT-vs-Claude-vs-Manus.webp)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- May 25, 2025\\\\\\\\n- Mark McNeece\\\\\\\\n- [AI](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/ai/), [AI Writing Tools](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/ai-writing-tools/), [ChatGPT](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/chatgpt/), [Claude 4](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/claude-4/), [Comparison](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/comparison/), [Manus](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/tag/manus/)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus Compared: Best AI Assistant for 2025\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI\\\\\'ve just finished the most fascinating three months of AI testing, and the results are absolutely wild. What started as a simple client question \\\\\\\\u2014 \\\\\\\\\\"Which AI tool should our content team invest in?\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\u2014 turned into a proper digital adventure that\\\\\'s completely changed how I think about AI assistants.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThree months, countless real-world projects, and more late-night testing sessions than my partner would approve of later, I\\\\\'ve got some seriously interesting insights about the AI assistant trinity of 2025.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nSpoiler alert: The answer isn\\\\\'t as straightforward as you\\\\\'d think, but it\\\\\'s way more exciting.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n* * *\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n![ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus AI Assistants](https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Three-futuristic-AI-robots-facing-off-in-a-high-tech-boxing-ring-1024x574.png)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Meet Your New AI Assistants \\\\\\\\u26a1\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nBefore we dive into the nitty-gritty, let me introduce our contenders in this AI heavyweight bout:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**ChatGPT** \\\\\\\\u2014 OpenAI\\\\\'s renaissance artist. Does everything from debugging code to generating stunning images, usually while cracking jokes. It\\\\\'s like having that overachieving colleague who somehow makes being brilliant look effortless.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Claude** \\\\\\\\u2014 Anthropic\\\\\'s perfectionist poet. Fresh Claude 4 models (Sonnet 4 and Opus 4) have turned this thoughtful philosopher into an absolute writing and coding powerhouse. The kind of AI that makes you question whether humans are actually necessary for content creation.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Manus** \\\\\\\\u2014 The productivity ninja that doesn\\\\\'t believe in small talk. While others chat, Manus is quietly reorganising your entire content pipeline. Think ultra-efficient assistant who\\\\\'s finished next week\\\\\'s work before your morning coffee kicks in.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPersonal confession: I may have developed slight emotional attachments to all three AI assistants. Don\\\\\'t judge.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n* * *\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n![ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus: The best AI Tools working at advanced computer interfaces](https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Best-AI-Tools-working-at-advanced-computer-interfaces-1024x574.png)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\. The Brains Behind the Programs: Who Actually Gets Stuff Done \\\\\\\\ud83e\\\\\\\\udde0\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nLet\\\\\'s get down to brass tacks. When you\\\\\'re paying for premium AI (and trust me, the free versions are about as useful as a chocolate teapot for serious work), you want results that don\\\\\'t make you question your life choices.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### ChatGPT: The Visual Virtuoso\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nHere\\\\\'s where ChatGPT absolutely shines \\\\\\\\u2014 image generation has become mental. DALL-E integration means you can go from \\\\\\\\\\"I need a hero image for this blog post\\\\\\\\\\" to professional-quality visuals in about 30 seconds.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI tested it with everything from technical diagrams to abstract concepts. Asked for \\\\\\\\\\"a frustrated developer debugging CSS at 3 AM\\\\\\\\\\" and got something so accurate it was borderline creepy. The visual storytelling capabilities alone make it worth the subscription for content teams.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n> \\\\\\\\\\"GPT-4.1 is significantly better than GPT-4o at a variety of coding tasks, including agentically solving coding tasks, frontend coding, making fewer extraneous edits, following nuanced instructions\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\u2014 [OpenAI GPT-4.1 Announcement](https://openai.com/index/gpt-4-1/)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nBut here\\\\\'s where it gets interesting \\\\\\\\u2014 while ChatGPT excels at creative problem-solving and visual content, it sometimes gets a bit... chatty. Ask for a simple explanation and you might get a dissertation. Not always bad, but when you need three bullet points and get three paragraphs, it\\\\\'s like asking for a coffee and getting a chemistry lesson on caffeine extraction.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Claude 4: The Writing and Coding Champion\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNow, this is where things get properly exciting. Claude 4\\\\\'s latest models aren\\\\\'t just an upgrade \\\\\\\\u2014 they\\\\\'re a complete game-changer for anyone serious about writing or coding. We\\\\\'re talking about two new powerhouses: Sonnet 4 and Opus 4.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**What\\\\\'s actually new with Claude 4?** Everything that matters:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- **Sustained performance**: Opus 4 can work autonomously for up to 7 hours straight without losing focus. That\\\\\'s nearly a full workday of complex problem-solving.\\\\\\\\n- **Best-in-class coding**: Opus 4 scores 72.5% on SWE-bench (the gold standard for coding benchmarks), making it officially the world\\\\\'s best coding model.\\\\\\\\n- **Context mastery**: Both models handle massive documents with 200K+ tokens while remembering every detail from start to finish.\\\\\\\\n- **Hybrid reasoning**: They can switch between quick responses and deep thinking modes depending on task complexity.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThe difference is night and day. Where previous AI models would produce \\\\\\\\\\"good enough\\\\\\\\\\" code, Claude 4 writes code that makes you wonder if it\\\\\'s secretly pair-programming with senior developers. The logic is cleaner, the comments are actually useful, and it catches edge cases that would normally slip through.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nFor writing? It\\\\\'s even more impressive. Claude 4 understands context, tone, and audience in ways that feel genuinely human. I fed it our company\\\\\'s brand guidelines once, and it started writing content that matched our voice so perfectly, I had to double-check I hadn\\\\\'t accidentally hired a ghostwriter.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n> \\\\\\\\\\"Claude Opus 4 is the world\\\\\'s best coding model, with sustained performance on complex, long-running tasks and agent workflows. The model delivers sustained performance on long-running tasks that require focused effort and thousands of steps, with the ability to work continuously for several hours.\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\u2014 [Anthropic Claude 4 Release](https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nHonestly? I use Claude 4 daily now. It\\\\\'s become my go-to for anything requiring actual thinking. If you\\\\\'re serious about [WordPress hosting](https://www.365i.co.uk/wordpress-hosting/) and need AI that can handle complex technical documentation, Claude 4 is unmatched.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n![Manus AI Review 2025](https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Manus-AI-Review-2025-is-it-worth-the-cost-1024x574.png)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Manus: The Silent Achiever\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nManus doesn\\\\\'t do party tricks or philosophical discussions about the nature of creativity. It just gets stuff done. Think of it as that colleague who doesn\\\\\'t attend the office socials but somehow delivers twice as much work as everyone else.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI connected it to my [WordPress hosting](https://www.365i.co.uk/wordpress-hosting/) setup, and within 48 hours it had learned my writing style, identified content gaps, and started filling them. Creepy? A bit. Effective? Absolutely.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nFor more on how Manus compares head-to-head with ChatGPT specifically for WordPress users, check out [Manus vs ChatGPT: The Ultimate Showdown for WordPress Users in 2025](https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/2025/05/02/manus-vs-chatgpt-the-ultimate-showdown-for-wordpress-users-in-2025/).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n* * *\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n![ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus AI working together](https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/The-best-AI-Tools-as-robots-arm-wrestling-1024x574.webp)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\. Playing Nice with Your Tech Stack: Integration Reality Check \\\\\\\\ud83d\\\\\\\\udd17\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nRight, so they\\\\\'re all clever. But can they actually work with the tools we use daily? This is where the rubber meets the road, and where I discovered some genuinely surprising differences.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### ChatGPT\\\\\'s Plugin Paradise\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nChatGPT\\\\\'s ecosystem is like Amazon \\\\\\\\u2014 overwhelming at first, but brilliant once you know what you\\\\\'re looking for. I\\\\\'ve got it connected to everything from SEO tools to my project management system. (Still working on the c\\\\\\\\n...\\\\\\\\n[Content truncated due to length limit]\\",\\\\n    \\"Metadata\\": {\\\\n      \\"og:image\\": \\"https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ChatGPT-vs-Claude-vs-Manus.webp\\",\\\\n      \\"og:updated_time\\": \\"2025-05-25T21:09:03+01:00\\",\\\\n      \\"robots\\": \\"follow, index, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large\\",\\\\n      \\"article:author\\": \\"https://www.facebook.com/HostedBy365i/\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:description\\": \\"ChatGPT vs Claude vs Manus: in-depth 2025 comparison of AI assistants for content, code, and automation\\\\\\\\u2014pros, cons, pricing & real-world tests\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:data1\\": \\"Mark McNeece\\",\\\\n      \\"og:locale\\": \\"en_GB\\",\\\\n      \\"msapplication-TileImage\\": \\"https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/365i-Site-Icon-512x512-1-300x300.png\\",\\\\n      \\"ogLocale\\": \\"en_GB\\",\\\\n      \\"ogSiteName\\": \\"365i\\",\\\\n      \\"og:image:width\\": \\"1536\\",\\\\n      \\"og:type\\": \\"article\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:creator\\": \\"@bsolveit\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:label1\\": \\"Written by\\",\\\\n      \\"ogUrl\\": \\"https://www.365i.co.uk/blog/2025/05/24/chatgpt-vs-claude-vs-manus-compared-best-ai-assistant-for-2025/\\",\\\\n      \\"ogImage\\": \\"https://www.365i.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ChatGPT-vs-Claude-vs-Manus.webp\\",\\\\n      \\"viewport\\": \\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\",\\\\n      \\"article:publisher\\": \\"https://www.facebook.com/HostedBy365i/\\",\\\\n      \\"article:tag\\": [\\\\n        \\"AI\\",\\\\n        \\"AI Writing Tools\\",\\\\n        \\"ChatGPT\\",\\\\n        \\"Claude 4\\",\\\\n        \\"Comparison\\",\\\\n        \\"Manus\\"\\\\n      ],\\\\n      \\"twitter:card\\": \\"summary_large_image\\",\\\\n      \\"generator\\": \\"Elementor 3.29.0; features: e_font_icon_svg, additional_custom_breakpoints, e_local_google_fonts; settings: css_print_method-external, google_font-enabled, font_display-auto\\",\\\\n      \\"bingbot\\": \\"noarchive\\",\\\\n      \\"article:p